   825	All reads on Sol (gpt-5.6-sol): editorial 295k; cold 118k; source-distance 200k (1 tracked passage; probe 2% / 9%); plan / canon / protected-text audit 630k tokens (REPAIR, bounded; forty-one exact fixes). **Fourteen applied by the coordinator** (the ten marker restorations, minimal, with the source's speakers; Lira's false memory of the plank; Karis's bar; two "five years"). **Twenty-seven DECLINED:** the read at the seep removed and deployment forced to thirty-two (no plan text fixes the figure); Karis's night stripped of the two pages (it is the plan's refusal); the year mechanism replaced by flat lines (the protected close needs its ground — the author trims the display instead); the gloss after the log; nested asterisks in the log; Seln's "one to a year"; a sentence telling Oryn of the thirteenth. **Repair r1 in progress with the same author** (three joins, the year's display, one tracked chain, anchors for a listener).
